SET f.text = 'ap + bq = 0. We can put some numbers to this to make it more concrete. Suppose p = 0.3 and', f.meaning = '', f.sourceId = 'aat-ebook-20170711_copy', f.sectionId = 'aat-ebook-20170711_copy:12';
