SET f.text = 'q = 0.6. After some simple algebra we see that if a = 2 and b = −1 we have that ap + bq = 0,', f.meaning = '', f.sourceId = 'aat-ebook-20170711_copy', f.sectionId = 'aat-ebook-20170711_copy:12';
