SET f.text = 'y(t −1). The role of the ADF hypothesis test is to ascertain, statistically, whether γ = 0, which', f.meaning = 'would indicate (with α = β = 0) that the process is a random walk and thus non mean reverting.', f.sourceId = 'successful_algorithmic_trading', f.sectionId = 'successful_algorithmic_trading:11';
